# 部署值（npm run deploy 读取）。复制为 .deploy.env 后填写；.deploy.env 不进仓库。
# 同名环境变量优先于本文件（CI 用 GitHub Actions 仓库变量提供）。见 docs/DEPLOYMENT.md。

# 应用域名（Cloudflare DNS 上的主机名，不带 https:// 与路径）
READ_PODCAST_DOMAIN=your-domain.example
# 转录服务经 Cloudflare Tunnel 暴露的地址
READ_PODCAST_TRANSCRIPTION_URL=https://transcribe.your-domain.example
# Canonical Manuscript Store（GitHub 仓库）
READ_PODCAST_GITHUB_OWNER=your-github-username
READ_PODCAST_GITHUB_REPO=your-manuscript-repository

# 可选
# READ_PODCAST_GITHUB_BRANCH=main
# READ_PODCAST_GITHUB_PATH=podcasts/transcripts
# READ_PODCAST_TRANSCRIPTION_LANGUAGE=zh
# READ_PODCAST_TIME_ZONE=Asia/Shanghai
